{"id":"vod_bf_1296","vodId":"1296","provider":"bf","providerName":"暴风资源","type":2,"name":"暗杀教室第一季","name_cn":"暗杀教室第一季","date":"2015-01-01","year":"2015","region":"jp","area":"日本","platform":"日韩动漫","remarks":"完结","images":{"common":"https://p.bfvp26.com/upload/vod/20230424-2/4218ba6ac692ca572c46007e85684019.jpg"},"summary":"故事发生在椚丘中学三年E班，表面上，这是一个普通的班级，然而实际上，这里聚集着的均是技艺高超冷酷无情的杀手。每一年，他们通过特殊渠道接收着来自世界各地的暗杀任务，替各国首脑“排忧解难”，而这一次，他们有了一个统一的目标——刺杀班主任杀老师（福山润 配音）。　　杀老师是一个神奇的存在，它的外表并非人类，却有着及其敏感的神经和及其迅速的反应力，没有人知道它从哪里来，也没有人知道，它为何会变成三年E班的班主任。因为想要毁灭地球，杀老师成为了暗杀名单上的高价悬赏人物，而作为三年E班的学生，只要成功消灭杀老师，即可毕业。就这样，围绕着这位神秘的老师，充满了危险的日常就此展开。","rating":{"score":0},"tags":[{"name":"日本动画"}],"sourceType":"third-party","updatedAt":"2026-06-09 16:20:50","playable":true,"episodeCount":23,"classic":true,"playGroups":[{"name":"bfzym3u8","episodes":[{"name":"第00集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf2.com/video/anshajiaoshidiyiji/第00集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第01集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf2.com/video/anshajiaoshidiyiji/第01集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第02集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf2.com/video/anshajiaoshidiyiji/第02集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第03集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf2.com/video/anshajiaoshidiyiji/第03集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第04集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf2.com/video/anshajiaoshidiyiji/第04集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第05集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf2.com/video/anshajiaoshidiyiji/第05集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第06集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf2.com/video/anshajiaoshidiyiji/第06集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第07集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf2.com/video/anshajiaoshidiyiji/第07集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第08集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf2.com/video/anshajiaoshidiyiji/第08集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第09集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf2.com/video/anshajiaoshidiyiji/第09集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第10集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf2.com/video/anshajiaoshidiyiji/第10集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第11集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf2.com/video/anshajiaoshidiyiji/第11集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第12集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf2.com/video/anshajiaoshidiyiji/第12集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第13集","url":"https:/